  <item>
    <title>14 拒绝做职场“包子”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670b8cf4db2cf82757d7714f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670b8cf4db2cf82757d7714f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Oct 2024 09:03:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>偷懒了一整个国庆假期没有更新，节后我们又来啦，这一期主要要跟大家分享下职场拒绝这个话题，争取不做职场“包子”。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">0:01:48</a> &nbsp;工作中学会拒绝很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">0:04:16</a> 职责以外的工作莫挨我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="367">0:06:07</a> 职场上适当可以搭把手，但不能全做</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">0:07:00</a> 拒绝领导有技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="474">0:07:54</a> 拒绝非工作以外的要求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="554">0:09:14</a> 学会立“不好惹”职场人设</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">0:11:30</a> 不要害怕犯错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="749">0:12:29</a> 降低自己的责任心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">0:17:05</a> 不要因为工作自我内耗</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：吉祥 &nbsp;微博：波斯明教圣女</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：柒安 &nbsp;微博：chill柒安</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：柒安</span></p><span></span><p><span>投稿邮箱：18602520375@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
