  <item>
    <title>13 存钱or旅游，你怎么选？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f80f2f81cdab3a93b887ba</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f80f2f81cdab3a93b887ba</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 28 Sep 2024 14:14:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>国庆节前来一波更新，今天是两位主播对存钱和旅游两件事情谁更重要的battle之战，这也是现实与精神世界的一次battle,快来听听看吧!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">0:00:15</a> 存钱与旅游之间的battle</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="71">0:01:11</a> 柒安站存钱最重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="101">0:01:41</a> 存钱的目标是财务相对自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="418">0:06:58</a> 存钱有助于实现个人目标</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">0:08:50</a> 年轻人应先考虑降负债</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="671">0:11:11</a> 存钱应对通货膨胀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">0:15:14</a> 吉祥投旅游更重要一票</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="919">0:15:19</a> 旅游可以提高生活质量与幸福感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1145">0:19:05</a> 旅游是个人能力提升与锻炼独立思考能力的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">0:21:00</a> 旅行可以提高与人沟通的能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1514">0:25:14</a> 旅游可以增进亲密关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1642">0:27:22</a> 多走出去，拓宽认知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1737">0:28:57</a> 实际存钱生活场景与重感受的旅游并不冲突</span></p><span></span><p><span>旅游和存钱哪个更重要我们应该辩证的看待，其实应该找到两者平衡点，在有存款保障生活前提下开心旅游。欢迎大家留下自己的看法，多多评论哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：吉祥 &nbsp;微博：波斯明教圣女</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：柒安 &nbsp;微博：chill柒安</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：柒安</span></p><span></span><p><span>投稿邮箱：18602520375@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnMj9dPAG0s21XIXIyJKyOExmgVc.m4a" length="30157451" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:31:04</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjOL67bEgdl-YOIkblcN_n7Ja6rd.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
